                <pb facs="0535" n="423" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg423"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5130: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Harbin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jenkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-05T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                                1919, 5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>For Morris.</p>
                <p>Department approves withholding final statement to Kolchak Government for the
                    present as suggested in your August 30, 10 P.M. Before President returns to
                    Washington October 1st Department hopes you will also be able to present
                    comprehensive recommendations based on conference with Stevens and Smith as
                    suggested in Department’s July 11, 6 P.M.<anchor n="54" xml:id="d446-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
